          "script": "\t#system.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027canvasSize\u0027, {\u0027dir\u0027:self.view.params.param,\u0027value\u0027:self.getSibling(\"NumericInput\").props.params.value}, scope\u003d\u0027session\u0027)\n\tlastMongoLoadID\u003dsystem.util.jsonDecode(system.util.jsonEncode(self.view.custom.lastMongoLoadID))\n\tlastMongoLoadID[\u0027canvasSize\u0027]\u003dpayload\n\tself.view.custom.lastMongoLoadID\u003dlastMongoLoadID\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027updateLastMongo\u0027, lastMongoLoadID, scope\u003d\u0027page\u0027)\n",
